the royal family congratulates prince  harry and meghan markle on the birth of  their daughter lillabet  but a source is now telling e.t the  family still feels upset with the duke  and duchess of sussex following their  bombshell interview with oprah winfrey  in march  i think there is a desire on both parts  to move on from this family risk  the source explains that the royal  family made a coordinated public effort  to congratulate and offer harry and  megan well wishes on social media  after the birth of their baby lily but  the source adds that there are still  lingering feelings of disappointment and  anger after the couple's claims in their  explosive oprah interview  where they accused an unnamed member of  the royal family of expressing concern  about the potential color of their son  archie's skin  before he was born so the couple have  names their daughter  lily bert diana mount saturn windsor  which is quite a royal name megan and  harry welcome their daughter  lillabet lily diana mountbatten windsor  on friday  and gave her a name that sweetly honors  queen elizabeth ii  and the late princess diana in a  statement the couple explained that  lillabet  is harry's grandmother's family nickname  and diana was chosen to honor harry's  late mother  well these are two really significant  and important royal names  diana of course speaks for itself and  i've long heard that if  prince harry ever had a little girl he  was always going to honor his mother's  name  and give her diana as one of her names  but i think the greatest  surprise has been lily bert which  actually many people don't even know  is an affectionate nickname that was  given to the queen  when she was little she couldn't  pronounce elizabeth it came out lily  bette  when she was just two and it was such a  cute and lovely name it's stuck  and according to a statement from  buckingham palace the queen  prince charles and camilla and prince  william and kate middleton  are delighted by the news william and  kate also shared a message for the  couple  and their first child two-year-old son  archie on instagram  writing quote we are all delighted by  the happy news of the arrival of baby  lily congratulations to harry megan and  archie  we do understand that harry did ask his  grandmother  for her blessing that is protocol that  is traditional and certainly when it  comes to  the name lily bed i think absolutely  right that harry asked and of course the  queen would  would have been in a very difficult  position she couldn't very well have  said  no but i think the general feeling is  that she was quite surprised a little  bit taken back  charles and camilla followed with a  personal message of their own  tweeting quote congratulations to harry  megan and archie on the arrival of baby  lillabet diana  wishing them all well at this special  time prince harry's cousin princess  eugenie  also celebrated the milestone moment on  her insta story  writing congratulations dear cousins we  couldn't be happier for you all  well i think everyone's hope is that  this little baby is going to be  a rift healer um because this  family division has really gone on for a  very long time now it's well over a year  it's been many many months since charles  the queen indeed the cambridges have  seen archie  in the flesh and we know that there have  been some  really quite deep problems between harry  and william  difficulties between harry and his  father and i think it's everyone's  hope that this little baby will will be  a peace offering  in many ways and that she will help to  bring this divided family  back together meanwhile as harry and  megan enjoy the bliss  of baby number two e.t is also learning  more about the future of megan's career  as an  entertainer the source explains that the  39 year old actress has  no current plans to return to acting  adding that she is fulfilled with the  impactful work she and harry are doing  with their non-profit  archwell the source says that archwell  allows megan to quote  create content on positive public  discourse on the issues and ideals that  continue to drive the duke and duchess's  work the source adds that she's excited  about everything she and harry are  creating  and what the future has to offer for now  the source says megan is focused on  making a difference with archwell's work  [Music]
 

